or":"郑獬","text":"三日禁船官不容，波如连屋万千重。\n莫向长江争道路，如今风雨属蛟龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35461,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江梅","author":"郑獬","text":"杭州别乘有馀才，戏作佳篇寄我来。\n已教吴娘学新曲，凤山亭下赏江梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35462,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹 其二","author":"郑獬","text":"冰骨清疏绿玉君，连环高节粉花纹。\n截来好作仙翁帚，独倚扶桑扫白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35463,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹 其三","author":"郑獬","text":"鸾节朝元昨日归，玲珑玉佩解云衣。\n几多碧玉凤凰尾，斗向秋烟不肯飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35464,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹 其一","author":"郑獬","text":"经时不到紫云溪，新笋斓斑青玉枝。\n生怪南山恶风雨，夜来长得碧龙儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35465,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自天竺遇雨却回灵隐","author":"郑獬","text":"月桂峰前快雨飞，林间避雨亦沾衣。\n才晴便出西山路，却共断云相趁归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35466,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自灵隐回谒孤山勤上人","author":"郑獬","text":"猎猎长松十里风，归时路与北山通。\n陶潜今日无馀事，更过虎溪寻远公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35467,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自嘲","author":"郑獬","text":"乐府休翻白苧歌，樽前已怯卷红螺。\n壮心虽欲未伏老，争奈秋来白发何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35468,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中睡起","author":"郑獬","text":"铜盘绿水浸红蕖，风捲纱幮睡足初。\n金殿故人如借问，为言病酒懒修书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35469,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行次南都遇雨 其一","author":"郑獬","text":"雨声飘断忽南去，云势旋生从北流。\n料得凉风消息近，萧萧只在柳梢头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35470,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行次南都遇雨 其二","author":"郑獬","text":"老火烧空未拟收，忽惊快雨破新秋。\n晚云浓淡落日下，已似楚江南岸头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35471,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观涛","author":"郑獬","text":"怒涛沃日为之阴，下有蛟龙不测深。\n若比人间恶风浪，长江风浪本无心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35472,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过十丈山","author":"郑獬","text":"惯向长安事朝谒，满衫尘土厚于泥。\n行人若爱青山好，何不暂时留马蹄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35473,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山晚归","author":"郑獬","text":"饮散齐山晚，夕阳秋浦红。\n不须鞭五马，十里听松风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35474,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听泉","author":"郑獬","text":"为爱飞泉洒雪凉，无缘移近曲栏旁。\n直须买断清溪住，引取寒声绕卧床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35475,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汪正夫为人撰墓志有中金之赠因以二绝戏之 其一","author":"郑獬","text":"飘然才思是真仙，凤字仍留碧玉镌。\n换得黄金满书箧，可能独具买山钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35476,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汪正夫为人撰墓志有中金之赠因以二绝戏之 其二","author":"郑獬","text":"宝字奇文刻夜台，黄金论价未当才。\n诸生可是无豪气，不就韩公乞取来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35477,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤壁","author":"郑獬","text":"帐前斫案决大议，赤壁火船烧战旗。\n若使曹公忠汉室，周郎争敢破王师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35478,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵雨","author":"陆游","text":"潭底乖龙唤不应，骄阳似欲败西成。\n虚堂永夜耿无睡，起听四郊车水声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35479,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阻风游铜陵护法寺","author":"郑獬","text":"白浪浮江打白沙，江头绿竹对僧家。\n春风也似玉京好，一树残红山杏花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35480,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮醉","author":"郑獬","text":"小钟连罚十玻璃，醉倒南轩烂似泥。\n睡起不知人已散，斜阳犹在杏花西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35481,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其九","author":"郑獬","text":"探花最费庾郎才，欲把雕盘折取来。\n不奈雪花苦相误，梢头无处认真梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35482,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十三","author":"郑獬","text":"好花有意似怜才，时泛清香入袂来。\n待得繁梢都结实，莫将细核比杨梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35483,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其六","author":"郑獬","text":"妖花烂漫敌清才，邺骑还惊宝玦来。\n郑国枉教兰作佩，定应不识楚江梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35484,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十六","author":"郑獬","text":"木秃风摧正为才，几将挤陷九渊来。\n见君说著须酸鼻，何必樽前更食梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35485,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其七","author":"郑獬","text":"座中豪客洛阳才，醉舞春风拂袖来。\n明日却寻歌管地，中庭空有折残梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35486,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其二","author":"郑獬","text":"世上庸儿苦忌才，脱身曾把虎须来。\n他年若隐吴门去，从此真仙不姓梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35487,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其一","author":"郑獬","text":"少陵老杜独怜才，长句还如铁马来。\n酒味渐佳春渐好，苦教陆凯咏寒梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35488,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十一","author":"郑獬","text":"刘蕡直气压群才，却束尘衣取次来。\n开府刚肠破金石，可能刻意赋寒梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35489,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十七","author":"郑獬","text":"穷通系命不由才，富贵偏宜老后来。\n花草犹教有先后，凭君试看北枝梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35490,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十二","author":"郑獬","text":"欲酬强韵若为才，昨夜归时趁月来。\n寂寞后堂初醉起，金盆犹浸数枝梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35491,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十五","author":"郑獬","text":"江南还有谢娘才，试数春期几日来。\n綵胜未随钗上燕，玉台先插鬓边梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35492,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其三","author":"郑獬","text":"江南江北谪仙才，为爱湖山特地来。\n愿得春寒过三月，樽前留得腊前梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35493,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其五","author":"郑獬","text":"好花赋与本天才，料得灵根天上来。\n应为长安恶风土，故教北地不栽梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35494,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十","author":"郑獬","text":"诗入鸡林白傅才，当年曾佩左符来。\n尊前依旧江山好，不见章台驿使梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35495,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其四","author":"郑獬","text":"禁林自笑老无才，觅得杭州刺史来。\n饮散凭栏却怊怅，不堪忆著故园梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35496,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其十四","author":"郑獬","text":"流俗休教见美才，不如长入醉乡来。\n江南蚤是多风雨，莫向花前唱落梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35497,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪正夫梅 其八","author":"郑獬","text":"丽赋多传楚客才，新诗还自楚江来。\n雪痕未涨龙池水，风信先飞庾岭梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35498,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏史 其三","author":"郑獬","text":"汉家行赏尽论功，祸福于人岂易穷。\n解把旧恩酬项伯，独将大义斩丁公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35499,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏史 其一","author":"郑獬","text":"汉地龙蛇始遘迍，曹公崛起定经纶。\n阴谋用尽得天下，谁道彼雏解笑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35500,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏史 其二","author":"郑獬","text":"魏生被责灌将军，股慄如何不自陈。\n若使当时有英气，肯为丞相扫门人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35501,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿秘阁","author":"郑獬","text":"金马藏书大帝家，绕檐鸣玉滴冰牙。\n晚云不动寒风断，残雪时飞三两花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35502,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]